# SDK packages are published to GitHub Packages under the @senseering scope.
# GitHub Packages requires an auth token to INSTALL, even for public packages.
@senseering:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
auto-install-peers=true
# Auth is NOT committed. CI's setup-node injects the token line from
# NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (GITHUB_TOKEN in Actions). Locally, add this once to ~/.npmrc:
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<a GitHub PAT with read:packages>
# See docs/getting-started.md for the full consumer setup.
